OL,3,GNEWSAHospice fulfilled dad's last wish
OL,4,Ato die at home
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Tracy Lester's dad was diagnosed
OL,7,Fwith oesophageal junction cancer, her
OL,8,Fworld fell apart.
OL,10,FShe became his carer in the months
OL,11,Ffollowing, before his death in May last
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,F"It was a shock to us as a family as it
OL,15,Fall happened so quickly and it was
OL,16,Fheartbreaking to watch him
OL,17,Fdeteriorate", she said.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
